; DECnet-Start-Term - starts the services of DECnet-Term after dnetd:
; latd (LAT sessions, dnterm.device units 4 to 7) and, when enabled,
; the maintenance login (dnmaint). DECnet-Start runs it; DECnet-Stop
; runs DECnet-Stop-Term.
; Maintenance login settings: ENV:DECnet/maint-node, maint-password
; Logs: T:latd.log, T:dnmaint.log
; (a second latd or dnmaint ends at once: "already running")
If EXISTS DECnet:C/latd
  Run >NIL: latd LOG=T:latd.log
EndIf
If EXISTS ENV:DECnet/maint-password
  Run >NIL: dnmaint LOG=T:dnmaint.log
EndIf
